        "message": "Add opt-in Gazebo per-thread scheduler probe\n\nThe ten-trial recovery series stopped on a 158 ms in-pod physics stall\nduring FollowPath; existing evidence cannot distinguish run-queue\nstarvation from in-thread blocking. The resource probe now supports\n--watch-threads-of <comm>: a read-only /proc/<pid>/task/*/ sample of\nschedstat (on-CPU vs wait time), utime/stime, state, and context-switch\ncounters for every thread of the console Gazebo and Collision Monitor\nprocesses at 20 ms. Gated behind a new --gz-thread-probe runner flag\nrequiring the console-only hotel profile and excluded from the\nmoving-timing trace; recorded in the run summary. Diagnostic only: no\nsafety path, threshold, or qualification profile changes."
      },
